      "lng": null,
      "born": 1798,
      "died": 1830,
      "born_confidence": "approximate",
      "died_confidence": "approximate",
      "region": "France",
      "note": "Builder and director at Strasbourg, important to the eastern and Italian extensions. The dossier records only that the brothers remained administrators until retirement under the Restoration, not an exact date; he lived until 1849.",
      "sources": [
        "https://fnarh.net/les-telecommunications-francaises-1793-2000/"
